('FR000080', 'FIR-2024-0078', 'CS000068', 'Complainant Chakradev Boase reported at Ganapathy Mandi police station in Madurai on 08-Sep-2024 that Falguni Barad (alias Pickle65) and Omisha Srivastava of the Black Lotus Network gang demanded a periodic levy of Rs. 633525 and threatened consequences on refusal. On 31/08/2024, Falguni Barad called complainant twice from phone 8190723856 and repeated the demand, warning of seizure. The accused were last seen departing in vehicle registration TN30 AT 2792. FIR Number FIR-2024-0078 registered under Case Number CASE-0068; offences under Section 170 IPC and 506(2) IPC shall be investigated. Investigating officer: si ramesh babu.', '2024-10-02T19:11:32Z', 'LOC000028', 'SYNTHETIC', '2026-09-07T05:25:48.448718Z'),
