('FR000082', 'FIR-2024-0080', 'CS000070', 'Complainant Xiti Kanda reported at Velachery Oil Depot police station in Kancheepuram on 23-Nov-2024 that Aayush Sachdeva (alias Vikram97) and Aayush Sachdeva of the North Star Outfit gang demanded a periodic levy of Rs. 3187874 and threatened consequences on refusal. On 21/11/2024, Aayush Sachdeva called complainant twice from phone 6659111855 and repeated the demand, warning of seizure. The accused were last seen departing in vehicle registration TN58 AH 4988. FIR Number FIR-2024-0080 registered under Case Number CASE-0070; offences under 506(2) IPC and 506(2) IPC shall be investigated. Investigating officer: ci sandeep kumar.', '2024-11-29T08:56:44Z', 'LOC000002', 'SYNTHETIC', '2026-09-07T05:25:48.451009Z'),
