('FR000085', 'FIR-2024-0083', 'CS000071', 'Complainant Panini Patla, resident of Thiruvarur, stated under Section 154 CrPC that between 12-Sep-2024 and 13-Sep-2024, Nirja Bava (alias Boss89) and Zarna Menon, acting for Crimson Tide Group gang, induced deposits into A/C XXXX2789 and layered the proceeds through multiple accounts. On 03/09/2024 a sum of Rs. 21239863 was routed from the said A/C XXXX2789 to a shell entity. Suspects used phone 8551248250 to co-ordinate transfers with accomplices. Nirja Bava was last seen near Thirunagar Cold Storage in a vehicle bearing registration TN38 UP 8266. FIR Number FIR-2024-0083 registered under Case Number CASE-0071 for offences under Section 120B IPC and Section 120B IPC. investigation flagging the transaction trail to inspector deepa nanduri of the financial forensic unit.', '2024-09-15T07:19:36Z', 'LOC000003', 'SYNTHETIC', '2026-09-07T05:25:48.454641Z'),
