('FR000093', 'FIR-2024-0091', 'CS000077', 'On 30/09/2024 at around 21:00 hrs complainant Yochana Chanda was waylaid at Chokkanadar Pettai Oil Depot, Villupuram, by Azaan Swamy (alias Raja54) and Damini Dutt, members of the Black Lotus Network gang, who relieved him of cash and valuables worth Rs. 2032589 at knifepoint. Azaan Swamy was identified through his phone 6265117603 and the getaway vehicle registration TN38 KG 9141 recovered on 09-Oct-2024. FIR Number FIR-2024-0091 under Case Number CASE-0077; offences under Section 506(2) IPC registered. Investigation entrusted to si priya darshan.', '2024-11-06T01:08:34Z', 'LOC000009', 'SYNTHETIC', '2026-09-07T05:25:48.463731Z'),
('FR000094', 'FIR-2026-0092', 'CS000078', 'Based on secret intelligence, on 14-May-2026 a consignment was intercepted at Estancia Bridge End, Madurai. Complainant Brinda Bobal identified Oni Borde (alias Machan19) and Oni Borde as the handlers coordinating with Eastern Arc Outfit gang operatives. On 07/05/2026 both suspects were observed near the godown; Oni Borde arrived in vehicle registration TN01 ZH 4647 and communicated with the group using phone 9356369014. Contraband valuation is assessed at Rs. 15974798. FIR Number FIR-2026-0092 under Case Number CASE-0078 was registered; offences under NDPS Act 23 are being investigated by inspector deepa nanduri.', '2026-06-22T04:49:40Z', 'LOC000014', 'SYNTHETIC', '2026-09-07T05:25:48.464811Z'),
('FR000095', 'FIR-2025-0093', 'CS000079', 'Complainant Maanas Rau reported on 16-Apr-2025 the theft of his vehicle from Anna Nagar Check Post, Tiruchchirappalli, on 10/04/2025. ANPR caught registration TN63 US 7528 on the bypass; Dayita Nadig (alias Silk) and Zarna Menon were identified via phone 9166779843 and CCTV of Anna Nagar Check Post. Stolen parts worth Rs. 524264 were recovered. FIR Number FIR-2025-0093 under Case Number CASE-0079, offences under Section 379 IPC and 411 IPC. Investigation: special sub-inspector emmanuel.', '2025-04-23T17:20:53Z', 'LOC000025', 'SYNTHETIC', '2026-09-07T05:25:48.465859Z'),
